<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 99-3 V LEICESTERSHIRE - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 99-3 V LEICESTERSHIRE - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>LEICESTER, England 1997-06-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were 99 for</p>
